{
	"title": "Décomposer une fraction décimale",
	"description": "Écrire une fraction décimale comme un entier plus des fractions décimales de numérateur inférieur à 10, et l'inverse (4 107/1 000 = 4 + 1/10 + 0/100 + 7/1 000)",
	"grades": ["CM2"],
	"theme": "Fractions",
	"domain": "Apprivoiser",
	"subdomain": "Décomposition",
	"level": 8,
	"delay": 30,
	"status": "draft",
	"options": {
		"constraints": {
			"reducedFractions": "off",
			"spacesFromFourDigits": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Écris cette fraction comme la somme d'un nombre entier et de fractions dont le numérateur est inférieur à $10$.\n\n$$\\frac{{{a}}}{1000} = ? + \\frac{?}{10} + \\frac{?}{100} + \\frac{?}{1000}$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "0..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "0..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "v",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "eval:1000*q+100*t+10*u+v"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{q}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{t}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{u}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{v}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Une unité, c'est $\\frac{1000}{1000}$ ; un dixième, $\\frac{100}{1000}$ ; un centième, $\\frac{10}{1000}$.**",
					"$$\\frac{{{a}}}{1000} = \\frac{{{eval:1000*q}}}{1000} + \\frac{{{eval:100*t}}}{1000} + \\frac{{{eval:10*u}}}{1000} + \\frac{{{v}}}{1000}$$",
					"$$\\frac{{{a}}}{1000} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{q}}} + \\frac{\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{t}}}}{10} + \\frac{\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{u}}}}{100} + \\frac{\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{v}}}}{1000}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Écris cette somme sous la forme d'une seule fraction décimale.\n\n$${{q}} + \\frac{{{t}}}{10} + \\frac{{{v}}}{1000} = \\frac{?}{1000}$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "v",
					"expression": "1..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "eval:1000*q+100*t+v"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{a}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Tout en millièmes.** ${{q}} = \\frac{{{eval:1000*q}}}{1000}$ et $\\frac{{{t}}}{10} = \\frac{{{eval:100*t}}}{1000}$ ; il n'y a aucun centième.",
					"$${{q}} + \\frac{{{t}}}{10} + \\frac{{{v}}}{1000} = \\frac{{{eval:1000*q}}}{1000} + \\frac{{{eval:100*t}}}{1000} + \\frac{{{v}}}{1000} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\frac{{{a}}}{1000}}$$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "4107/1000 = 4 + 1/10 + 0/100 + 7/1000",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"q": "4",
				"t": "1",
				"u": "0",
				"v": "7",
				"a": "4107"
			},
			"answers": ["4", "1", "0", "7"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 4 + 1/10 + 7/100 + 0/1000 (zéro mal placé)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"q": "4",
				"t": "1",
				"u": "0",
				"v": "7",
				"a": "4107"
			},
			"answers": ["4", "1", "7", "0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 41 + 0/10 + 0/100 + 7/1000",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"q": "4",
				"t": "1",
				"u": "0",
				"v": "7",
				"a": "4107"
			},
			"answers": ["41", "0", "0", "7"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
